 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "I like:",
   "texto": [
    "«Gustar» is not a verb in Japanese: it is said with **すき** (liked) + **です**. What you like carries the particle **が**: **さかな が すき です** (I like fish).",
    "**だいすき** = I love it. **きらい** expresses displeasure; its intensity depends on the context.",
    "Denial: **すき じゃ ありません** (I don't like it). To soften it **あまり**: **あまり すき じゃ ありません** (I don't like it very much) is added."
   ]
  },
